        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude-crib" ana="#fromLatin" corresp="#wit-du">that, if this man, on account of this charge, now at present puts his hand into this water boiling with fire, and is not guilty in this matter, you deign to grant him this, that no injury or harm may appear on that same hand, through which he would incur false accusation without guilt.</ab>
